a then e:   removed [a e] cleared [b c d]
all but c:  removed [a b d e] cleared [c]
b then c:   removed [b c] cleared [a e d]
b then d:   removed [b d] cleared [a e c]
e then a:   removed [e a] cleared [b c d]
first a:    removed [a] cleared [b c d e]
last e:     removed [e] cleared [a b c d]
middle b:   removed [b] cleared [a e c d]
middle c:   removed [c] cleared [a b e d]
none:       removed [] cleared [a b c d e]
